      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Reaction Management",
      "id": "reaction-management",
      "intro": "Reactions adalah tindakan otomatis yang terikat (binding) dengan White List tertentu. Ketika transaksi cocok dengan White List, sistem akan menjalankan reaction yang terkait. Fitur ini diakses melalui tombol 'Review Reactions' di Detail Panel.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Membuka Reaction Dialog",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Pilih salah satu White List untuk membuka Detail Panel.\n• Klik tombol **Review Reactions** (ikon external link) di panel detail.\n• Dialog full-screen berukuran 1400px akan terbuka dengan judul sesuai entity type White List.\n• Badge header menampilkan: **White List**, **Value**, **Active from**, dan **Active to** dari white list terpilih.\n• Dialog memiliki 1 tab: **Reactions**.",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.15);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#fff;width:340px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;background:#f8fafc;\"><div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:6px;\"><div style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f59e0b,#d97706);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M3 3h18v18h-18z\"/><path d=\"M3 9h18m-18 6h18\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">IP_ADDRESS</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Manage and monitor white list reactions within the system</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;\"><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:12px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">White List</span><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:12px;background:#eff6ff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#2563eb;\">Value: 192.168.1.100</span><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:12px;background:#fef3c7;border:1px solid #fde68a;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#d97706;\">Active from: 15 Jun 2025</span></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:14px 16px;\"><div style=\"padding:6px 16px;border-radius:20px;background:#f59e0b;border:1px solid #f59e0b;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:12px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z\"/></svg>Reactions</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin-bottom:8px;\">Reaction Dataset</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#fff;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:4px;\"><div style=\"width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#f59e0b;\"></div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">SET_RESPCODE</div></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">ID: #12345678</div></div><div style=\"padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#fff;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:4px;\"><div style=\"width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#10b981;\"></div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">EMAIL_NOTIFICATION</div></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">ID: #23456789</div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Daftar Reactions",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Halaman utama menampilkan **Reaction Dataset** dalam bentuk **Table View** (default) dengan kolom:\n  - **Reaction**: Nama action (SET_RESPCODE, EMAIL_NOTIFICATION, dll) dengan ID reaction\n  - **Description**: Deskripsi reaction\n  - **Priority**: Nilai prioritas (1-10)\n• Toolbar memiliki tombol: **Search Reaction**, **Add New Reaction**, **Edit Reaction**, dan **Delete Reaction**.\n• Klik row untuk membuka Detail Panel reaction di sisi kanan.\n• Support pagination dan sorting.",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.1);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#fff;width:320px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;background:#f8fafc;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;margin-bottom:8px;\">Reaction Dataset</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><div style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#eff6ff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#3b82f6;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"/><line x1=\"21\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"16.65\" y2=\"16.65\"/></svg>Search</div><div style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#10b981;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"5\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"19\"/><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"/></svg>Add</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#fff;border-left:3px solid #f59e0b;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;margin-bottom:6px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#f59e0b;\"></div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">SET_RESPCODE</div></div><span style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f0fdf4;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#10b981;\">Priority: 5</span></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:4px;\">Override response code for approved transactions</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;\">ID: #12345678</div></div><div style=\"padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#fff;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;margin-bottom:6px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#3b82f6;\"></div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">EMAIL_NOTIFICATION</div></div><span style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#fef3c7;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#d97706;\">Priority: 3</span></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:4px;\">Send email notification to security team</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;\">ID: #23456789</div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Add & Edit Reaction",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n**Form Configuration** (drawer 560px dari sisi kanan):\n\n1. **Priority** (required): Slider 1-10 untuk menentukan urutan eksekusi reaction\n2. **Description** (required): Textarea untuk deskripsi reaction\n3. **Action** (required): Dropdown pilihan tipe reaction:\n   - SET_RESPCODE: Override response code\n   - EMAIL_NOTIFICATION: Kirim email\n   - CREATE_ACQUIRER_ALERT: Buat alert acquirer\n   - CREATE_ISSUER_ALERT: Buat alert issuer\n   - ATTR_WHITE_LIST: Tambah atribut ke white list\n   - ATTR_STOP_LIST: Tambah atribut ke stop list\n   - ATTR_WATCH_LIST: Tambah atribut ke watch list\n\n**Form Dinamis berdasarkan Action:**\n\n• **SET_RESPCODE**: Pilih Response Code dari dropdown\n• **EMAIL_NOTIFICATION**: Pilih Recipient Type (RECIPIENT/RECIPIENT_GROUP), Recipient/Group, dan Message Template\n• **ATTR_WHITE_LIST/ATTR_STOP_LIST**: Pilih Attribute, Date From, Has Expiration Date, Date To, Reason\n• **ATTR_WATCH_LIST**: Pilih Attribute, List, Date From, Has Expiration Date, Date To, Reason\n• **CREATE_ACQUIRER_ALERT/CREATE_ISSUER_ALERT**: Tidak ada conditional field tambahan — form hanya berisi Core Fields (Priority, Description, dan Action)",
          "color": "#10b981",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.15);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#fff;width:300px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0fdf4,#dcfce7);\"><div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:8px;background:#10b981;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Create Reaction</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Configure reaction rules and actions</div></div></div></div><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:12px;background:#dcfce7;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">● Add</span></div><div style=\"padding:14px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;margin-bottom:2px;\">Reaction Configuration</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Priority</div><div style=\"position:relative;height:20px;background:#e2e8f0;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:50%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#10b981,#059669);border-radius:10px;\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;right:10px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">5</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Description <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:7px;font-size:11px;color:#94a3b8;height:40px;\">Enter description...</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Action <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;border:1.5px solid #10b981;border-radius:7px;font-size:11px;color:#0f172a;background:#f0fdf4;\">SET_RESPCODE</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Response Code <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:7px;font-size:11px;color:#94a3b8;\">Choose response code</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#f8fafc;display:flex;gap:8px;\"><button style=\"flex:1;padding:7px;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#475569;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;\">Cancel</button><button style=\"flex:1;padding:7px;border-radius:7px;background:#10b981;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;\">Create</button></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Search Reaction",
          "desc": "• Klik tombol **Search Reaction** untuk membuka panel search (320px) di sisi kanan.\n• Panel memiliki 1 filter: **Action** (dropdown pilihan tipe reaction).\n• Klik **Apply Filters** untuk menerapkan pencarian.\n• Klik **Reset** untuk menghapus filter dan menampilkan semua reaction."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
